type: software
title: "Water Quality Classification via Cost-Efficient Machine Learning: A Case Study in Nuevo León (code and data)"
abstract: >-
  Code, processed data, and figures to reproduce the machine learning
  analysis that classifies Water Quality Index (WQI) categories from
  REMANECA (CONAGUA) monitoring data in Nuevo León, Mexico.
